---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Our Agency"
	description="Learn about our mission, engineering philosophy, and the team driving digital innovation."
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg"
>
	<h2>Engineering the Next Generation of the Web</h2>
	<p>
		We are a specialized digital product agency focused on web performance, scalable architecture, and modern user experiences. Founded by developers who saw a gap between complex enterprise software and slow, bloat-heavy agency sites, we set out to build digital products that are fast by default, accessible to everyone, and built to scale.
	</p>

	<h2>Our Philosophy</h2>
	<p>
		Great software is not just about writing code—it is about solving core business problems with minimal friction. We prioritize clean architecture, strict type safety, and zero-compromise performance across every project we take on.
	</p>

	<ul class="principles-list">
		<li><strong>Performance First:</strong> Sub-second load times and 90+ Lighthouse metrics are non-negotiable standards.</li>
		<li><strong>Future-Proof Tech:</strong> We leverage Astro, React, and modern TypeScript stack environments to prevent architectural debt.</li>
		<li><strong>Clear Transparency:</strong> Direct communication with developers, continuous delivery, and zero unexpected scope bloat.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>How We Partner with Clients</h2>
	<p>
		Whether you need a complete ground-up build, a high-converting marketing platform, or an audit to fix legacy performance bottlenecks, we embed directly into your workflow. We act as an extension of your team, taking ownership from initial technical design through post-launch deployment and monitoring.
	</p>

	<div class="cta-box">
		<h3>Ready to upgrade your web presence?</h3>
		<p>Let's discuss your technical requirements and build something exceptional together.</p>
		<a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Schedule a Technical Call</a>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.principles-list {
		margin: 1.5em 0;
		padding-left: 1.2em;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.principles-list strong {
		color: #0f172a;
	}

	.cta-box {
		margin-top: 3em;
		padding: 2em;
		background: #f8fafc;
		border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
		border-radius: 8px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.cta-box h3 {
		margin-top: 0;
		color: #0f172a;
	}

	.cta-box p {
		color: #64748b;
		margin-bottom: 1.5em;
	}

	.btn-primary {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.75em 1.5em;
		background: #0f172a;
		color: #ffffff;
		border-radius: 6px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: background 0.2s ease;
	}

	.btn-primary:hover {
		background: #1e293b;
	}
</style>